OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who risked his own life to rescue
OL,7,Fa stranger from drowning 30 years ago
OL,8,Fis trying to track him down.
OL,10,FLee Heyes jumped into a quarry when he
OL,11,Fwas 15 after he realised the older teen
OL,12,Fhad got into difficulty.
OL,14,FThe now 45-year-old, from Chorley, who
OL,15,Fhas written a song about the ordeal,
OL,16,Fsaid instinct took over when the
OL,17,Fstranger, who he thinks was about 18 or
OL,18,F19, jumped in the water at Eccleston
OL,19,FDelph and disappeared under the surface
OL,20,Fafter getting tangled in reeds.
